00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:45.000 line:80%
<i>In eight more hours, we will witness</i>

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:47.880 line:80%
<i>the grand reunification ceremony</i>
<i>of Hong Kong and China.</i>

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:52.040 line:80%
<i>This is a moment we have</i>
<i>been waiting for 155 years.</i>

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:52.720 line:80%
WELCOME BACK, HONG KONG

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:58.520 line:80%
<i>The midnight of July 1st, 1997</i>
<i>is approaching steadily.</i>

00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:10.600 line:80%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:15.120 line:80%
What was it again? Good

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:18.040 line:80%
afternoon, Sir.

00:02:28.320 --> 00:02:30.880 line:80%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:48.440 line:80%
No parking here.

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:50.960 line:80%
No parking here. Go.

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:52.680 line:80%
Hey!

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:54.480 line:80%
Where did she go?

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:03.560 line:80%
A relative of someone here?

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:10.080 line:80%
Look. That guy.

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:10.760 line:80%
NEW YORK BLOCK

00:03:10.840 --> 00:03:11.920 line:80%
Why is he in black?

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:24.280 line:80%
They didn't even pick up the kid
after they bumped into him.

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:43.320 line:80%
Qiang.

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:44.320 line:80%
Qiang.

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:52.120 line:80%
Eighteenth floor?

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:54.160 line:20%
I thought no one lived there anymore.

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:05.800 line:80%
Qiang.

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:13.440 line:80%
Do you see what's on her back…

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:14.760 line:80%
-What are you staring at?
-Oh my!

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:16.520 line:80%
Nothing.

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:19.040 line:80%
I have a meeting at the provincial office.

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:20.800 line:80%
Keep your eyes open.
Make sure nothing happens.

00:04:20.879 --> 00:04:21.920 line:80%
Okay.

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:32.760 line:80%
The janitor said she went
to the 18th floor.

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:34.120 line:80%
18th floor? It's already haunted

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:35.400 line:80%
before they raided
the prostitution rings here.

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:37.720 line:80%
Eighteenth floor?
Wasn't the underground club raided?

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:39.000 line:80%
Where did they go?

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:30.920 line:80%
It's you, Ma Qiang?

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:34.680 line:80%
Weird. Both fire exits are locked.

00:05:34.760 --> 00:05:36.600 line:80%
Where could those two have gone?

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:39.160 line:80%
Don't touch anything.
Go downstairs to find them.

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:42.680 line:80%
What's the matter, Wang?

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:50.160 line:80%
Wang Wuluan. What are you doing?

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:02.560 line:80%
Why is there a pair of footprints here?

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:35.840 line:80%
There's no one in there.

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:49.160 line:80%
Call 110!

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:03.040 line:80%
Puking before you go to work.

00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:07.200 line:80%
This must be your first day, rookie.

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:09.760 line:80%
I'm getting motion sickness.
You drove too fast.

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:14.040 line:80%
Liu. After you're done puking,
come here. I want to talk to you.

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.680 line:80%
Come here. I want to talk to you.

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:21.560 line:80%
Listen.

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:26.240 line:80%
Listen.

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:28.760 line:80%
We've been asked
to team up at the last minute.

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:31.880 line:80%
Even though it's quite ad hoc,
rules must be established.

00:07:31.960 --> 00:07:34.240 line:80%
I know. Captain Feng said
you came to assist

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:35.600 line:80%
and would go back after a week.

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:36.840 line:80%
-They asked me to…
-They asked you

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:38.400 line:80%
not to give me any trouble. Right?

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:41.720 line:80%
They asked me to guide you
through our work.

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:45.760 line:80%
Who's guiding whom now? You're a rookie.

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:47.720 line:80%
Do you know how many years
I've been doing this?

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:51.520 line:80%
But you've been working
in a police station.

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:53.280 line:80%
I studied for six years to become
a criminal police officer.

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:56.240 line:80%
You only know the theories.

00:07:56.320 --> 00:07:57.760 line:80%
Enough chatting.

00:07:57.840 --> 00:08:00.400 line:80%
The old guide the young.
That's the rule in the squad.

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:02.480 line:80%
Captain Feng only told me
to partner up with you.

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:05.000 line:80%
Even in a partnership,
there's a pecking order.

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:06.680 line:80%
I'm the mentor. You're my apprentice.

00:08:06.760 --> 00:08:08.920 line:80%
When we work, you listen to me.

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:16.320 line:80%
So, how do you want to proceed today?

00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:17.600 line:80%
That's the right attitude.

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:21.440 line:80%
Listen. I was in charge of Yuanlongli
when I was working in the police station.

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:23.840 line:80%
Back then, the workers dug out a cenotaph.

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:27.680 line:80%
After that, the residents
became paranoid and superstitious.

00:08:27.760 --> 00:08:29.360 line:80%
They keep calling the police for nothing.

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:32.800 line:80%
-So?
-So, we stay put.

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:34.359 line:80%
We let them cool their heads.

00:08:34.440 --> 00:08:35.800 line:80%
I disagree.

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:39.599 line:80%
If paranoia isn't solved in time,
it might evolve into a collective risk.

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:42.120 line:80%
Did I just establish
the pecking order for nothing?

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:44.280 line:80%
I'm your mentor. You're my apprentice.

00:08:44.360 --> 00:08:46.120 line:80%
-If I tell you to do this…
-Mr. He.

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:47.960 line:80%
Can we work now?

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:51.560 line:80%
Mr… Mr. He? You think I'm a mechanic?

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:53.280 line:80%
More like someone who fixes gas lights.

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:54.400 line:80%
What gas lights?

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:56.240 line:80%
Gaslighting. Gaslight.

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:57.800 line:80%
Did you just tell me to bugger off?

00:08:58.360 --> 00:09:00.320 line:80%
So rude.

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:08.720 line:80%
Something bad happened
in Yuanlongli just now.

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:12.240 line:80%
Do you want to know?
A woman was carrying a man on her back

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:14.360 line:80%
up to the 18th floor.

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:15.880 line:80%
How creepy!

00:09:15.960 --> 00:09:17.560 line:80%
A man and a woman.

00:09:17.640 --> 00:09:20.040 line:80%
Both covered in black.

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:20.960 line:80%
Gone.

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:23.000 line:80%
Not even bones left.

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:25.080 line:80%
I saw with my own eyes.

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:26.680 line:80%
You saw with your own eyes.

00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:30.480 line:80%
Meng. Come here.

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:37.560 line:80%
Not even bones left. I see.

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:40.480 line:80%
Officer He. That's my cloak.

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:42.320 line:80%
Didn't you say it killed two people?

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:43.440 line:80%
It's now evidence.

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:46.120 line:80%
I have to keep it to examine it.

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:47.960 line:80%
Who else witnessed it?

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:49.680 line:80%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:55.080 line:80%
POLICE

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:58.120 line:80%
Calling the police
for the slightest inconvenience.

00:09:58.200 --> 00:09:59.400 line:80%
How many times has it been?

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:01.000 line:80%
You two.

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:02.600 line:80%
One is from the residents committee.
One is from the security team.

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:05.680 line:80%
Instead of dispelling
the superstition, you fanned it.

00:10:05.760 --> 00:10:07.960 line:80%
Making a fake police call is a crime.
Do you understand?

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:09.440 line:80%
Yes.

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:11.640 line:80%
There's no victim and no culprit.

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:13.160 line:80%
Their relatives
also didn't call the police.

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:14.920 line:80%
There's nothing to file a case here.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.800 line:80%
Besides, the police already came here.

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:19.160 line:20%
Come. Sign it.

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:23.640 line:80%
One more week,
and I'll go back to my previous post.

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:26.000 line:80%
Do you get what I mean?

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:27.720 line:80%
It's the last sprint.

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:30.480 line:80%
Don't go to the criminal department
and bother me for something trivial.

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:31.720 line:80%
If I get a case,
I won't be able to go back.

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:34.400 line:80%
-Just sign it.
-I… Where do I sign it?

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:38.000 line:80%
This young man is…

00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:41.080 line:80%
Oh, he's Liu. My apprentice.

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:42.720 line:80%
He just graduated.
It's his first day at work.

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:45.000 line:80%
He's new here.
Do look after him, will you?

00:10:46.360 --> 00:10:48.720 line:80%
Hello. I'm Ran. R-A-N.

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:50.840 line:80%
Also, I'm not his…

00:10:57.600 --> 00:10:59.360 line:20%
WITNESS' STATEMENT

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:05.000 line:80%
Hi. Are you Li Tieling?

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:08.000 line:80%
So the woman and the old man
disappeared when you turned around.

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:11.440 line:80%
Yes. The woman was wearing a white dress
and blue leather heels.

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:13.120 line:80%
She vanished just like that.

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:15.480 line:80%
-Do you want to know how they vanished?
-Yes.

00:11:15.560 --> 00:11:17.800 line:80%
Re-enact what you did
when you chased the rickshaws away.

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:18.840 line:80%
Then turn around and look at me.

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:23.080 line:80%
Okay. No parking here. Go. Go.

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:24.000 line:80%
Are you insane?

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:25.920 line:80%
Then I…

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:30.360 line:80%
He's gone. He's gone.

00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:31.760 line:80%
I'm here.

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:35.480 line:80%
You assumed they would cross
the main road to enter the gate.

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:36.800 line:80%
But they stuck to the wall,

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:38.560 line:80%
just outside your line of vision.

00:11:39.960 --> 00:11:41.360 line:80%
This is called a psychological blind spot.

00:11:41.440 --> 00:11:42.880 line:80%
Watch me do it again.

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:45.320 line:80%
You explained the trick.

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:47.320 line:80%
Why bother doing it again?

00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:51.280 line:80%
It's called re-enactment.

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:52.800 line:80%
According to the Western
investigation procedures,

00:11:52.880 --> 00:11:55.920 line:80%
you must imagine that you're the culprit
and re-enact what they did.

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:57.240 line:80%
Enact what?

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:58.600 line:80%
Re… enact?

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:04.000 line:80%
From this place to that block,
taking the main road is the shorter route.

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:06.720 line:80%
Why did they take a detour then?

00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:09.040 line:80%
Come with me.

00:12:12.320 --> 00:12:13.680 line:80%
Where are we going?

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:16.080 line:80%
Case closed.

00:12:16.160 --> 00:12:17.720 line:80%
They didn't ask for criminal police.

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:20.320 line:80%
Captain Feng got a call and asked us
to assess the situation personally.

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:22.280 line:80%
We didn't even enter the premises.
Isn't that too irresponsible?

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:24.040 line:80%
Irresponsible?

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:26.040 line:80%
Making a fake police call
is irresponsible.

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:27.440 line:80%
It's a waste of police resources too.

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:32.280 line:80%
Sir, we over-reacted here. Please go back.

00:12:32.360 --> 00:12:33.600 line:80%
I'll just talk to Officer Qu.

00:12:33.680 --> 00:12:35.480 line:80%
Wait. Officer Qu?

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:37.360 line:80%
Which one? Qu Dahai?

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:41.760 line:80%
Yes. I called 110, and Officer Qu came.

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:42.680 line:80%
He's inside the building?

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:45.360 line:80%
I'll go and take a look.

00:12:52.400 --> 00:12:55.120 line:80%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:12:57.440 --> 00:12:59.600 line:80%
That woman carried the old man

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:02.400 line:80%
and stood still here.
She even took off her heels.

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:04.040 line:80%
What else did she do?

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:09.560 line:80%
She did this.

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:14.840 line:80%
I can fix it.

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:22.760 line:80%
I'll pick it up.

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:34.800 line:80%
So clumsy. Hurry up.

00:13:40.240 --> 00:13:42.680 line:80%
Officer Qu. Careful. The footprints.

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:51.160 line:80%
What are you doing?

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:52.920 line:80%
PATTIA CLUB

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:55.880 line:80%
He Yuanhang. What brings you here?

00:13:56.760 --> 00:13:58.880 line:80%
Han. Shouhu.

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:01.360 line:80%
What are you doing here? Go back.

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:02.320 line:80%
Did I say you could go back?

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:03.360 line:80%
Continue.

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:05.200 line:80%
Your footsteps are making a mess.

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:08.440 line:80%
Are you examining
or contaminating the crime scene?

00:14:08.520 --> 00:14:09.920 line:80%
Who says I'm examining the scene?

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:12.120 line:80%
I'm looking for the culprit. Continue!

00:14:13.480 --> 00:14:14.840 line:80%
Touch anything if you dare.

00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:17.320 line:80%
Excuse me. You're blocking the evidence.

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:22.160 line:80%
See? The criminal police are working.

00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:23.440 line:80%
Now work!

00:14:24.360 --> 00:14:25.560 line:80%
You little…

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:40.640 line:80%
I like him. What's his name?

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:45.400 line:80%
Ran Fangxu. My apprentice.

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:47.000 line:80%
Top scorer from People's Public Security
University of China, PPSUC.

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:48.200 line:80%
PPSUC?

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:50.800 line:80%
Your apprentice?

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:52.760 line:80%
Why would I have
brought him here with me, otherwise?

00:14:53.800 --> 00:14:54.640 line:80%
Jealous?

00:14:55.400 --> 00:14:57.480 line:80%
Want to join the criminal department?

00:14:57.560 --> 00:14:59.200 line:80%
I can talk to Captain Feng for you.

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:02.200 line:80%
You can have him.

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:04.000 line:80%
Sounds good?

00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:16.240 line:80%
This wooden plank is so annoying.

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:18.480 line:80%
Well, it's all thanks to your mentor.

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:20.360 line:80%
He did this when he raided
the prostitution ring.

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:21.640 line:80%
That's right.

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:26.720 line:80%
Let me borrow this.

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:30.440 line:80%
He is not my mentor.

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:35.920 line:80%
You liar.

00:15:38.320 --> 00:15:39.480 line:80%
-Ma Qiang.
-Yes.

00:15:39.560 --> 00:15:41.400 line:80%
-Open the door.
-Okay.

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:50.400 line:80%
Forgive me. I conducted an experiment.

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:51.480 line:80%
What are you doing?

00:15:52.440 --> 00:15:55.000 line:80%
Seriously? It's called enaction. Right?

00:15:57.400 --> 00:15:59.360 line:80%
Re-enactment.

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:03.040 line:80%
There's a nail on the door frame.

00:16:03.120 --> 00:16:04.720 line:80%
The dust by the door frame is gone.

00:16:04.800 --> 00:16:07.840 line:80%
I suppose someone
hung the black cloak here.

00:16:10.560 --> 00:16:12.680 line:80%
The height of it is enough
to cover an adult

00:16:12.760 --> 00:16:14.440 line:80%
when someone opens the door.

00:16:15.480 --> 00:16:16.600 line:80%
A prank then?

00:16:17.320 --> 00:16:18.440 line:80%
But there's one unanswered question.

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:20.200 line:80%
The footprints disappear here.

00:16:20.280 --> 00:16:22.080 line:80%
They didn't go back the way they came.

00:16:22.720 --> 00:16:24.920 line:80%
Qu Dahai and his men stepped
all over the place.

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:26.120 line:80%
How can we trace footprints now?

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:27.400 line:80%
Dust can be thick.

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:29.800 line:80%
New and old footprints have gaps.

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:31.720 line:80%
You're so thorough, Fangxu.

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:32.840 line:80%
You left no stone unturned.

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:36.000 line:80%
Unlike someone I know
who has peanuts for a brain.

00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:37.160 line:80%
All empty inside.

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:39.120 line:80%
You have peanuts for a brain.

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:40.040 line:80%
Move.

00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:43.480 line:80%
How can you be a criminal police
with such a bad core strength?

00:16:46.120 --> 00:16:47.960 line:80%
Size 37 feet.

00:16:48.640 --> 00:16:51.720 line:80%
Carrying an old man
all the way from outside.

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:54.880 line:80%
She must be a strong woman.

00:16:57.200 --> 00:17:00.040 line:80%
These must be the basics
you learned in PPSUC.

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:01.560 line:80%
They don't teach you common sense.

00:17:04.680 --> 00:17:05.720 line:80%
You little…

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:16.680 line:80%
What did you see?

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:23.320 line:80%
Four cigarette butts.

00:17:23.399 --> 00:17:25.040 line:80%
Judging from their looks,

00:17:25.119 --> 00:17:27.159 line:80%
they were used less than two hours ago.

00:17:27.680 --> 00:17:31.360 line:80%
Judging from the charred ends,
the smoker was anxious.

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:33.400 line:80%
Some of them were thrown away
after a few puffs were taken.

00:17:35.160 --> 00:17:36.720 line:80%
Do you recognize the brand?

00:17:36.800 --> 00:17:38.080 line:80%
How much does it cost?

00:17:41.520 --> 00:17:43.320 line:80%
A packet of Yuxi cigarettes.

00:17:43.400 --> 00:17:46.000 line:80%
Mainly for bosses.
Twenty yuan for one packet.

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:57.080 line:80%
Are you sure there were
no footprints in the room?

00:17:57.160 --> 00:17:58.640 line:80%
I guess so.

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:02.400 line:80%
We came looking for the culprit.

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:04.040 line:80%
Of course, we walked around.

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:09.560 line:80%
Then don't walk that much.

00:18:18.760 --> 00:18:22.240 line:80%
BEIJING TRAVEL

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:28.320 line:80%
Officer He. Officer Qu.

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:30.200 line:80%
Calm down. Tell me clearly.

00:18:30.280 --> 00:18:34.320 line:80%
Okay. I checked all the rooms.
There's no one.

00:18:34.400 --> 00:18:37.120 line:80%
I also checked the security cameras.
No one took the elevator.

00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:41.320 line:80%
Two adults couldn't possibly
vanish just like that.

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:42.760 line:80%
They must be somewhere.

00:18:42.840 --> 00:18:44.680 line:80%
Both sides of the staircase
are locked from the outside too.

00:18:44.760 --> 00:18:45.600 line:80%
Where else could they go?

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:48.680 line:80%
It looks like a locked room.

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:51.200 line:80%
Three paths.

00:18:52.200 --> 00:18:53.440 line:80%
The staircase is locked.

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:55.720 line:80%
The elevator has security cameras.

00:18:55.800 --> 00:18:59.800 line:80%
Exactly. It's weird.
That's why I called Captain Feng.

00:19:00.520 --> 00:19:04.520 line:80%
I think you should file a case.

00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:07.600 line:80%
File what case? What case?

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:09.440 line:80%
Let me explain everything to you.

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:12.880 line:80%
The door is locked from the outside.
You can't open it.

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:28.920 line:80%
See? They left like this.

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:30.560 line:80%
This door isn't locked.

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:32.200 line:80%
File a case?

00:19:32.280 --> 00:19:34.160 line:80%
This is just a prank. Okay?

00:19:34.240 --> 00:19:36.240 line:80%
Officer He. This isn't right.

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:38.120 line:80%
The staircase. The window.

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:40.240 line:80%
And the padlock. The padlock!

00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:42.200 line:80%
What? Isn't it…

00:19:45.320 --> 00:19:47.200 line:80%
-Surround them from both sides!
-On it!

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:00.640 line:80%
Stay right there!

00:20:03.560 --> 00:20:04.640 line:80%
Wait for me.

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:07.160 line:80%
Sorry, I'm in a hurry.
Take the next one. Sorry.

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:08.560 line:80%
Stealing a lock before the police.

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:10.080 line:80%
How dare you!

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:11.280 line:80%
Stop right there.

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:14.200 line:80%
Stop right there. Stop right there.

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:15.960 line:80%
What are you doing?

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:45.640 line:80%
He Yuanhang!

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:47.920 line:80%
I caught him. He Yuanhang! Help me!

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:49.160 line:80%
Why are you yelling?

00:20:49.960 --> 00:20:50.800 line:80%
Stop yelling.

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:52.200 line:80%
You took the elevator,
but you're still slow!

00:20:52.280 --> 00:20:53.480 line:80%
He has already run away!

00:21:00.560 --> 00:21:01.840 line:80%
Be careful.

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:02.840 line:80%
NEW YORK BLOCK

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:04.480 line:80%
Officer He!

00:21:06.720 --> 00:21:08.680 line:80%
Officer He. Officer He.

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:10.360 line:80%
There are bad guys in the block.

00:21:10.440 --> 00:21:12.040 line:80%
They scared my son.

00:21:13.600 --> 00:21:15.760 line:80%
Were you running around
the staircase just now?

00:21:17.560 --> 00:21:19.440 line:80%
Why did you go to the 18th floor?

00:21:19.520 --> 00:21:21.280 line:80%
He saw everything.

00:21:21.360 --> 00:21:23.440 line:80%
He even bumped into them.

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:24.600 line:80%
Tell me.

00:21:24.680 --> 00:21:27.400 line:80%
Why did you lock us in the staircase?

00:21:27.480 --> 00:21:29.600 line:80%
I was scared you'd come after me.

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:34.440 line:80%
Hey there. It's okay.

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:36.800 line:80%
You saw the two missing persons, right?

00:21:37.680 --> 00:21:39.800 line:80%
I saw their hands.

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:42.840 line:80%
It's not human hands. They have claws.

00:21:52.680 --> 00:21:53.600 line:80%
Claws?

00:21:53.680 --> 00:21:55.920 line:80%
Is that coming from your exaggeration?

00:22:01.840 --> 00:22:04.160 line:80%
See? I told you so.

00:22:04.240 --> 00:22:06.240 line:80%
They bumped into him,

00:22:06.320 --> 00:22:07.800 line:80%
and they didn't even pick him up.

00:22:07.880 --> 00:22:10.200 line:80%
They bumped into him how many times?

00:22:10.280 --> 00:22:11.120 line:80%
Just once.

00:22:11.200 --> 00:22:12.800 line:80%
And he got bruises everywhere?

00:22:12.880 --> 00:22:14.600 line:80%
It's as if he has been run over.

00:22:14.680 --> 00:22:17.880 line:80%
-Little one, your bruises are…
-I fell when he chased after me.

00:22:26.520 --> 00:22:28.720 line:80%
Officer He. Listen.

00:22:28.800 --> 00:22:30.720 line:80%
We put the padlock
when we were checking the place.

00:22:30.800 --> 00:22:33.640 line:80%
I don't care who put it there.
I just want to know if it was locked.

00:22:33.720 --> 00:22:34.840 line:80%
No, it wasn't.

00:22:35.880 --> 00:22:36.760 line:80%
It wasn't locked?

00:22:36.840 --> 00:22:39.320 line:80%
That means those two people
could leave through that door.

00:22:40.080 --> 00:22:41.200 line:80%
I guess so.

00:22:47.320 --> 00:22:48.320 line:80%
You examined the place for hours,

00:22:48.400 --> 00:22:51.000 line:80%
and you couldn't figure out
one simple staircase.

00:22:51.080 --> 00:22:53.320 line:80%
Qu. Given your lack of competence,

00:22:53.400 --> 00:22:55.120 line:80%
how am I supposed
to put in a few good words for you?

00:22:55.920 --> 00:22:56.880 line:80%
Say no more.

00:22:58.920 --> 00:23:02.240 line:80%
Don't just stand there.
This is just a prank.

00:23:02.320 --> 00:23:03.680 line:80%
Go back and pack up. Case closed!

00:23:05.040 --> 00:23:06.920 line:80%
I already told you so.

00:23:07.000 --> 00:23:08.960 line:80%
The reunification of Hong Kong
is more interesting.

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:15.320 line:20%
Officer He. We need to file a case.

00:23:25.320 --> 00:23:27.360 line:80%
Then explain. Why?

00:23:27.440 --> 00:23:30.120 line:80%
Ma Qiang said there were
no footprints in the western corridor.

00:23:30.200 --> 00:23:32.560 line:80%
They also said the cloak
took two people away.

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:34.120 line:80%
They make things up all the time.

00:23:34.200 --> 00:23:35.280 line:80%
How can I believe them?

00:23:35.360 --> 00:23:37.080 line:80%
Be patient. Let me finish.

00:23:37.160 --> 00:23:39.400 line:80%
Just tell me what you want to do.

00:23:40.200 --> 00:23:42.160 line:80%
I just want to get to the bottom
of this case.

00:23:42.240 --> 00:23:44.640 line:80%
Listen carefully.
One, this isn't even a case.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:48.360 line:80%
Two, if you want to investigate,
find another partner. Don't…

00:23:48.440 --> 00:23:50.120 line:80%
Don't bother you as you're about
to go back to being the deputy director.

00:23:50.200 --> 00:23:51.520 line:80%
I get it.

00:23:51.600 --> 00:23:53.320 line:80%
I knew you were that kind of person
from the start.

00:23:53.400 --> 00:23:54.880 line:80%
Just gaslighting people.

00:24:01.240 --> 00:24:04.000 line:80%
Did you scold me just now?

00:24:14.320 --> 00:24:17.120 line:20%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:24:24.200 --> 00:24:29.040 line:80%
WEIYANG PUBLIC SECURITY BUREAU
NANSHAN BRANCH

00:24:36.520 --> 00:24:37.680 line:80%
This one is…

00:24:44.200 --> 00:24:45.920 line:80%
Kid.

00:24:46.000 --> 00:24:47.920 line:80%
Did you see Ran?

00:24:48.000 --> 00:24:50.280 line:80%
Lan? Who?

00:24:50.360 --> 00:24:52.720 line:80%
R-A-N.

00:24:52.800 --> 00:24:53.760 line:80%
You must be new here.

00:24:53.840 --> 00:24:55.920 line:80%
-I…
-He Yuanhang. Stop yelling.

00:24:56.000 --> 00:24:57.240 line:80%
Can't you see we're working here?

00:24:57.320 --> 00:24:59.080 line:80%
I'm looking for Ran.

00:25:00.440 --> 00:25:02.120 line:80%
Something happened in Yuanlongli again?

00:25:02.200 --> 00:25:03.760 line:80%
Go back to your work.

00:25:03.840 --> 00:25:06.000 line:80%
Don't pester me.

00:25:08.160 --> 00:25:11.080 line:80%
Ran Fangxu is slacking
in the archive room.

00:25:11.680 --> 00:25:13.160 line:80%
Do talk to him.

00:25:14.960 --> 00:25:16.360 line:80%
He could've answered my call.

00:25:16.440 --> 00:25:17.720 line:80%
I called him for five minutes.

00:25:17.800 --> 00:25:19.440 line:80%
All of them are so lazy.

00:25:20.720 --> 00:25:22.080 line:80%
He is Mr. He.

00:25:28.160 --> 00:25:31.160 line:80%
Old Geezer. Why are you here again?

00:25:31.240 --> 00:25:33.600 line:80%
Don't call me old geezer.

00:25:33.680 --> 00:25:34.720 line:80%
Where is Ran?

00:25:36.720 --> 00:25:37.640 line:80%
Why do you need him?

00:25:39.160 --> 00:25:40.960 line:80%
It's none of your business. Where is he?

00:25:47.240 --> 00:25:49.000 line:80%
You eat to sleep, sleep to eat.

00:25:49.080 --> 00:25:50.840 line:80%
Where's your spirit?

00:25:50.920 --> 00:25:53.200 line:80%
Everyone gets bored
when they work here every day.

00:25:54.440 --> 00:25:55.800 line:80%
Why don't you ask them
to put me on patrol duty?

00:25:55.880 --> 00:25:57.240 line:80%
Ran Fangxu!

00:25:57.800 --> 00:25:59.280 line:80%
MEN'S TOILETS

00:26:19.280 --> 00:26:21.360 line:80%
UNDER MAINTENANCE

00:26:21.440 --> 00:26:22.680 line:80%
Ran Fangxu!

00:26:28.440 --> 00:26:29.440 line:80%
Ran Fangxu!

00:26:29.520 --> 00:26:30.760 line:80%
Just because you're standing
on the toilet bowl

00:26:30.840 --> 00:26:32.400 line:80%
doesn't mean I won't know you're here.

00:26:32.480 --> 00:26:34.200 line:80%
Come out. Open the door.

00:26:34.280 --> 00:26:36.440 line:80%
Sir. I have diarrhea.

00:26:36.520 --> 00:26:37.720 line:80%
I'm vomiting and pooping.

00:26:37.800 --> 00:26:39.280 line:80%
I can't go anywhere.

00:26:39.360 --> 00:26:41.440 line:80%
Are you an ostrich
that poops while standing?

00:26:41.520 --> 00:26:43.000 line:80%
Come out now.

00:26:43.080 --> 00:26:44.320 line:80%
I'll count to three.

00:26:44.400 --> 00:26:46.760 line:80%
Count to 300, and I still won't come out.

00:26:46.840 --> 00:26:47.960 line:80%
Just you wait.

00:26:48.840 --> 00:26:50.120 line:80%
-One.
-Sir.

00:26:50.640 --> 00:26:51.600 line:80%
-Two.
-What are you doing?

00:26:51.680 --> 00:26:52.600 line:80%
-Sir?
-Three!

00:26:59.880 --> 00:27:01.120 line:80%
Hey!

00:27:03.920 --> 00:27:05.520 line:80%
Sir,

00:27:05.600 --> 00:27:07.520 line:80%
I just finished this lesson plan.

00:27:08.640 --> 00:27:12.880 line:80%
Oh, you and your useless theories again.

00:27:13.480 --> 00:27:16.320 line:80%
I have a case that concerns my reputation.

00:27:17.000 --> 00:27:17.960 line:80%
You have a reputation?

00:27:18.040 --> 00:27:19.440 line:80%
I'll tell you on the way.

00:27:20.880 --> 00:27:22.640 line:80%
Sir, I have work to do.

00:27:22.720 --> 00:27:24.440 line:80%
Bah! This is what you call work?

00:27:24.520 --> 00:27:27.120 line:80%
Some people love to be on patrol duty.

00:27:27.200 --> 00:27:29.640 line:80%
Some people just want to stay
in the archive room.

00:27:30.240 --> 00:27:32.080 line:80%
I can't catch a break at all.

00:27:33.120 --> 00:27:34.400 line:80%
What are you implying?

00:27:40.840 --> 00:27:41.760 line:80%
Mister,

00:27:42.280 --> 00:27:43.640 line:80%
can you drive slower?

00:27:45.000 --> 00:27:46.080 line:80%
Slower?

00:27:46.640 --> 00:27:49.200 line:80%
Back then, on our first gig together,

00:27:50.000 --> 00:27:53.360 line:80%
I drove slightly faster
and you got your panties in a twist.

00:27:54.960 --> 00:27:57.520 line:80%
I… I have motion sickness.

00:27:58.240 --> 00:28:01.880 line:80%
Besides, it wasn't like you drove fast
to investigate the case.

00:28:02.760 --> 00:28:04.160 line:80%
Nonsense!

00:28:04.240 --> 00:28:06.760 line:80%
Don't make it sound
like I'm irresponsible.

00:28:08.560 --> 00:28:10.920 line:80%
When we first worked together,

00:28:11.000 --> 00:28:12.960 line:80%
you didn't even bother memorizing
my surname.

00:28:13.760 --> 00:28:14.840 line:80%
I…

00:28:26.520 --> 00:28:28.560 line:80%
All right. This is it.

00:28:29.160 --> 00:28:30.360 line:80%
I'm not driving over there.

00:28:30.440 --> 00:28:32.120 line:80%
That place brings bad luck.

00:28:33.680 --> 00:28:34.640 line:80%
Pay up.

00:28:34.720 --> 00:28:35.800 line:80%
Okay.

00:28:35.880 --> 00:28:36.920 line:80%
Let's go.

00:28:38.920 --> 00:28:40.840 line:80%
You didn't tell me
we'd come to Yuanlongli.

00:28:41.440 --> 00:28:43.800 line:80%
Come on. If I told you,
you wouldn't want to come with me.

00:28:43.880 --> 00:28:45.160 line:80%
Come down now.

00:28:45.240 --> 00:28:46.920 line:80%
I'm just here on a business trip.

00:28:47.000 --> 00:28:48.680 line:80%
I'll be back after a week.

00:28:49.280 --> 00:28:51.080 line:80%
You're going back to Beijing after a week?

00:28:52.200 --> 00:28:54.320 line:80%
Did you bring me with you
for another case?

00:29:03.640 --> 00:29:05.320 line:80%
His name is Han Zi'ang.

00:29:05.400 --> 00:29:07.280 line:80%
He went missing less than 48 hours ago.

00:29:07.360 --> 00:29:08.400 line:80%
They haven't filed the case yet.

00:29:08.480 --> 00:29:10.680 line:80%
I've talked to the parents,

00:29:10.760 --> 00:29:13.160 line:80%
and I think there's more
than meets the eye.

00:29:13.240 --> 00:29:15.240 line:80%
I agreed to help them.

00:29:15.800 --> 00:29:19.080 line:80%
After all these years, I've become
quite good at finding missing persons.

00:29:19.160 --> 00:29:21.680 line:80%
They call me human radar.

00:29:22.400 --> 00:29:24.480 line:80%
If there's more to the case
than meets the eye,

00:29:24.560 --> 00:29:25.920 line:80%
then hand the case over to the police.

00:29:26.000 --> 00:29:28.040 line:80%
As I said, they haven't
filed the case yet.

00:29:28.120 --> 00:29:31.320 line:80%
I'm just a kind citizen who wants
to locate the missing child.

00:29:31.400 --> 00:29:33.560 line:80%
Since we're here already,
just help me out.

00:29:33.640 --> 00:29:38.560 line:80%
-My reputation is at stake here.
-Sir, I'm a teacher now.

00:29:38.640 --> 00:29:40.720 line:80%
And you're retired.
We can't investigate cases anymore.

00:29:40.800 --> 00:29:42.200 line:80%
Let's just leave.

00:29:42.280 --> 00:29:43.480 line:80%
Don't give me excuses.

00:29:43.560 --> 00:29:44.840 line:80%
Eighteen years ago,

00:29:44.920 --> 00:29:46.760 line:80%
I too was eager to leave after a week.

00:29:46.840 --> 00:29:49.800 line:80%
But a jerk came to me
and said I was irresponsible.

00:29:56.120 --> 00:29:57.560 line:80%
Sorry, sir.

00:29:58.360 --> 00:29:59.560 line:80%
Back then, it was my fault.

00:30:02.200 --> 00:30:05.160 line:80%
It's not your fault.
It's not anyone's fault.

00:30:05.240 --> 00:30:06.880 line:80%
If I must put the blame on something,

00:30:06.960 --> 00:30:09.400 line:80%
it's on the fact that you didn't build
a good relationship with me.

00:30:11.480 --> 00:30:13.560 line:80%
I didn't build
a good relationship with you?

00:30:13.640 --> 00:30:15.640 line:80%
-I kept addressing you as my mentor then.
-Nonsense!

00:30:15.720 --> 00:30:17.560 line:80%
Stop wasting my time. Get out of the car.

00:30:20.920 --> 00:30:23.280 line:80%
Slow down. Slow down.

00:30:27.000 --> 00:30:29.840 line:80%
You keep saying that you don't
want to come to Yuanlongli.

00:30:29.920 --> 00:30:32.720 line:80%
But once you're in here,
you walk briskly like an eager visitor.

00:30:34.520 --> 00:30:36.080 line:80%
That's because
you were gaslighting me again.

00:30:37.040 --> 00:30:40.320 line:80%
I see you're not on social media.
It's not called gaslighting anymore.

00:30:40.400 --> 00:30:42.400 line:80%
It's called brainwashing. Come.

00:30:45.840 --> 00:30:47.600 line:80%
Let's take a break.

00:30:47.680 --> 00:30:50.160 line:80%
Don't. We can't stay here for long.

00:30:50.240 --> 00:30:54.320 line:80%
This building is haunted.
Once in a while, it'll kill someone.

00:30:54.400 --> 00:30:55.720 line:80%
Two policemen died here.

00:30:55.800 --> 00:30:56.640 line:80%
Died here?

00:30:56.720 --> 00:30:58.520 line:80%
One of them was in charge of this place.

00:30:58.600 --> 00:31:01.000 line:80%
-What's his name again?
-He something.

00:31:01.080 --> 00:31:03.080 line:80%
When they found him, his body was impaled

00:31:03.160 --> 00:31:05.960 line:80%
by a spear on this wall.

00:31:06.040 --> 00:31:07.200 line:80%
It was horrifying.

00:31:08.240 --> 00:31:09.760 line:80%
Quickly now.

00:31:09.840 --> 00:31:12.120 line:80%
You two look horrifying.

00:31:12.200 --> 00:31:15.200 line:80%
Mister. We weren't even talking about you.
Why are you yelling at me?

00:31:16.000 --> 00:31:17.880 line:80%
-Sir.
-Don't hold me back.

00:31:17.960 --> 00:31:21.480 line:80%
Tell me. How was I impaled on this wall?

00:31:28.200 --> 00:31:29.920 line:80%
Oh my…

00:31:38.520 --> 00:31:42.600 line:80%
Sir, Yuanlongli houses
a superstitious community.

00:31:42.680 --> 00:31:44.000 line:80%
You know that already.

00:31:44.080 --> 00:31:45.480 line:80%
Why pick a bone with them?

00:31:45.560 --> 00:31:48.800 line:80%
If I don't scold them now,
the next one they curse will be you.

00:31:57.480 --> 00:31:59.120 line:80%
You're dead.

00:31:59.200 --> 00:32:01.480 line:80%
You can't step on the 18th floor.

00:32:01.560 --> 00:32:03.240 line:80%
<i>Yuanlongli</i>

00:32:03.320 --> 00:32:08.760 line:80%
-<i>Eighteenth floor, 18 pillars</i>
-<i>Eighteenth floor…</i>

00:32:08.840 --> 00:32:14.280 line:80%
<i>Eighteenth floor with 18 pillars</i>

00:32:14.360 --> 00:32:19.400 line:80%
<i>Eighteen pillars</i>
<i>With 18 men to carry them…</i>

00:32:20.800 --> 00:32:22.520 line:80%
They are still singing the nursery rhyme?

00:32:22.600 --> 00:32:26.240 line:80%
If you hadn't insisted
on investigating the truth,

00:32:26.320 --> 00:32:29.840 line:80%
this so-called haunted building
would've taken more lives.

00:32:30.840 --> 00:32:36.040 line:80%
<i>Eighteenth floor with 18 pillars</i>

00:32:36.120 --> 00:32:41.160 line:80%
<i>Eighteen bodies, 18 heads</i>

00:32:52.520 --> 00:32:53.560 line:80%
He Yuanhang.

00:32:54.360 --> 00:32:55.360 line:80%
You owe me a meal.

00:32:55.440 --> 00:32:56.520 line:80%
For what?

00:32:56.600 --> 00:32:59.600 line:80%
WEIYANG CULTURAL CENTER

00:32:59.680 --> 00:33:00.920 line:80%
Aren't you investigating a case?

00:33:01.000 --> 00:33:03.520 line:80%
I jumped the queue for you
and got the report ready.

00:33:05.360 --> 00:33:07.960 line:80%
Six more days till I return
to the police station.

00:33:08.040 --> 00:33:09.040 line:80%
What case is this?

00:33:09.840 --> 00:33:11.480 line:80%
Come on. They sent
the evidence for analysis.

00:33:12.080 --> 00:33:13.280 line:80%
Two sets of fingerprints.

00:33:13.360 --> 00:33:14.280 line:80%
Four cigarette butts.

00:33:14.360 --> 00:33:17.160 line:80%
One cloak. And one security footage.

00:33:17.240 --> 00:33:18.800 line:80%
It's all under your name.

00:33:21.920 --> 00:33:22.760 line:80%
I…

00:33:23.800 --> 00:33:24.840 line:80%
It was all good.

00:33:26.200 --> 00:33:29.760 line:80%
Except Mr. He Yuanhang
and I don't get along well.

00:33:29.840 --> 00:33:31.840 line:80%
Can you get me another partner?

00:33:31.920 --> 00:33:33.640 line:80%
Changing your partner on your first day?

00:33:33.720 --> 00:33:34.880 line:80%
What did He Yuanhang do?

00:33:34.960 --> 00:33:36.600 line:80%
I don't think he has…

00:33:37.760 --> 00:33:40.320 line:80%
Captain Feng. I'm here
to find my apprentice.

00:33:40.960 --> 00:33:42.160 line:80%
Let me reiterate.

00:33:42.240 --> 00:33:43.440 line:80%
I am not your apprentice.

00:33:43.520 --> 00:33:47.480 line:80%
Young and petty.
It's just a term. No need to overreact.

00:33:47.560 --> 00:33:49.960 line:80%
I'm not being petty.
I'm being responsible here.

00:33:50.880 --> 00:33:52.640 line:80%
Captain Feng. See this?

00:33:52.720 --> 00:33:54.880 line:80%
Our temperaments don't match.
Our personalities are different.

00:33:54.960 --> 00:33:57.160 line:80%
We argue often,
and that'll affect our work efficiency.

00:33:57.240 --> 00:33:59.160 line:80%
Since I'm going back
to the police station,

00:33:59.240 --> 00:34:01.400 line:80%
why don't you give him another partner?

00:34:01.480 --> 00:34:03.560 line:80%
I'll hand over whatever I'm doing to him.

00:34:07.999 --> 00:34:10.720 line:80%
I see you two are putting
on an act in front of me.

00:34:11.959 --> 00:34:15.519 line:80%
Just be frank. What help
do you need from me?

00:34:15.600 --> 00:34:17.039 line:80%
Captain Feng.

00:34:17.120 --> 00:34:19.200 line:80%
This is not an act.

00:34:19.280 --> 00:34:22.640 line:80%
-I mean it. I want to break…
-Break up!

00:34:26.640 --> 00:34:28.120 line:80%
-Captain Feng.
-I am.

00:34:34.320 --> 00:34:37.680 line:80%
Captain Feng. The embarrassing case
from Yuanlongli.

00:34:37.760 --> 00:34:39.519 line:80%
The residents have come forward.

00:34:39.600 --> 00:34:40.479 line:80%
What now?

00:34:40.560 --> 00:34:42.959 line:80%
He Yuanhang. Mind your words.

00:34:44.959 --> 00:34:48.720 line:80%
Maybe officers like you
think it's nothing.

00:34:48.800 --> 00:34:51.479 line:80%
But the residents are getting manic.

00:34:51.560 --> 00:34:55.039 line:80%
They are saying the two missing persons
are the Black and White Guards.

00:34:55.120 --> 00:34:56.519 line:80%
And the building is their hunting ground.

00:34:57.600 --> 00:34:59.520 line:80%
And they are singing this.

00:34:59.600 --> 00:35:00.920 line:80%
<i>Yuanlongli</i>

00:35:01.000 --> 00:35:02.480 line:80%
<i>Eighteenth floor</i>

00:35:02.560 --> 00:35:04.120 line:80%
<i>Eighteen bodies, 18 heads</i>

00:35:04.200 --> 00:35:05.120 line:80%
Nonsense.

00:35:05.200 --> 00:35:07.440 line:80%
Someone among them
is trying to spread a rumor.

00:35:10.040 --> 00:35:11.360 line:80%
Captain Feng.

00:35:11.440 --> 00:35:15.360 line:80%
When they were building Yuanlongli,
they found a tomb.

00:35:15.440 --> 00:35:16.920 line:80%
It was a cenotaph
from the Three Kingdoms period.

00:35:17.000 --> 00:35:18.200 line:80%
There were no human remains inside.

00:35:18.280 --> 00:35:21.120 line:80%
The Residents Committee
just has to clarify the rumors.

00:35:21.200 --> 00:35:23.720 line:80%
Why mobilize the criminal police?

00:35:23.800 --> 00:35:28.280 line:80%
The problem is that Yuanlongli
is a complex neighborhood.

00:35:28.840 --> 00:35:30.720 line:80%
You see all sorts of people there.

00:35:31.560 --> 00:35:33.040 line:80%
Someone went missing yesterday.

00:35:33.120 --> 00:35:34.240 line:80%
Then today, a nursery song
like that appeared.

00:35:34.320 --> 00:35:36.080 line:80%
Everyone is scared.

00:35:36.160 --> 00:35:38.880 line:80%
-Please help us find the truth.
-He Yuanhang.

00:35:40.640 --> 00:35:43.960 line:80%
What was yesterday's case about?

00:35:44.040 --> 00:35:46.800 line:80%
Qu Dahai had already determined
that it was just a prank.

00:35:46.880 --> 00:35:49.040 line:80%
-But I…
-It wasn't a prank at all.

00:35:50.240 --> 00:35:51.160 line:80%
Captain Feng.

00:35:52.360 --> 00:35:53.960 line:80%
I interviewed the witnesses last night.

00:35:54.040 --> 00:35:55.160 line:80%
I can confirm three things.

00:35:55.240 --> 00:35:58.280 line:80%
One. There are no footprints
deeper into the corridor.

00:35:58.360 --> 00:36:00.280 line:80%
Two. The security guards
put the padlock there.

00:36:00.360 --> 00:36:03.600 line:80%
Three. Mr. Liang broke the glass
of the door leading to the staircase.

00:36:03.680 --> 00:36:06.640 line:80%
Therefore, the exit path
Officer He described yesterday

00:36:06.720 --> 00:36:08.240 line:80%
could never have existed.

00:36:08.320 --> 00:36:10.800 line:80%
The disappearance of those two persons
is still an enigma.

00:36:15.080 --> 00:36:17.360 line:80%
Well said! I agree with Fangxu.

00:36:17.440 --> 00:36:18.520 line:80%
I also agree with him.

00:36:18.600 --> 00:36:21.600 line:80%
Trivial problems, when neglected,
will fester into major problems.

00:36:23.080 --> 00:36:24.640 line:80%
Rumors can be destructive.

00:36:38.680 --> 00:36:41.680 line:80%
Some say that He Yuanhang
only got into the criminal department

00:36:41.760 --> 00:36:43.040 line:80%
because of his connections.

00:36:43.120 --> 00:36:44.320 line:80%
Take a seat.

00:36:46.360 --> 00:36:50.960 line:80%
But in fact, I chose him
from among many candidates.

00:36:51.040 --> 00:36:52.320 line:80%
Captain Feng.

00:36:52.400 --> 00:36:55.080 line:80%
Even though he never receives
proper training,

00:36:55.160 --> 00:36:58.880 line:80%
the place he's in charge of consistently

00:36:58.960 --> 00:37:00.680 line:80%
has the highest clearance rate.

00:37:00.760 --> 00:37:02.400 line:80%
What does this mean?

00:37:02.480 --> 00:37:06.800 line:80%
It means he has something
neither of us has.

00:37:08.360 --> 00:37:10.760 line:80%
In certain areas,
he will be quite helpful.

00:37:11.360 --> 00:37:16.560 line:80%
But of course, you can also
help him with your expertise.

00:37:16.640 --> 00:37:18.000 line:80%
Do you get what I mean now?

00:37:19.560 --> 00:37:22.080 line:80%
Captain Feng,
about the case in Yuanlongli…

00:37:22.160 --> 00:37:25.160 line:80%
Both of you will follow up with the case.

00:37:27.480 --> 00:37:29.680 line:80%
Officer He. Don't let me keep you.
I have to go now.

00:37:30.600 --> 00:37:34.720 line:80%
POLICE BY THE PEOPLE
FOR THE PEOPLE

00:37:44.440 --> 00:37:48.440 line:80%
MISSING DOG

00:38:08.600 --> 00:38:09.640 line:80%
Stop.

00:38:10.800 --> 00:38:11.960 line:80%
Rewind a bit.

00:38:15.320 --> 00:38:16.440 line:80%
Here.

00:38:21.680 --> 00:38:23.840 line:80%
It looks like a cigarette.

00:38:23.920 --> 00:38:26.200 line:80%
Can you tell which brand it is?

00:38:28.760 --> 00:38:31.280 line:80%
No. No way.

00:38:32.760 --> 00:38:33.720 line:80%
No way.

00:38:43.440 --> 00:38:44.400 line:80%
It looks like

00:38:45.880 --> 00:38:47.800 line:80%
marks left by a medical paste.

00:38:53.200 --> 00:38:54.200 line:80%
What are you doing?

00:38:54.280 --> 00:38:55.920 line:80%
Did I sign this before you gave it
to the Forensic Department?

00:38:56.000 --> 00:38:57.680 line:80%
Is the Forensic Department
strapped for cash lately?

00:38:57.760 --> 00:38:59.760 line:80%
He Yuanhang! We're not done studying it.

00:38:59.840 --> 00:39:00.880 line:80%
What does studying it serve?

00:39:01.920 --> 00:39:02.760 line:80%
Hey!

00:39:07.240 --> 00:39:09.800 line:80%
MISSING PERSONS

00:39:14.640 --> 00:39:15.960 line:20%
MISSING PERSONS

00:39:16.040 --> 00:39:18.920 line:20%
FEMALE: AROUND 20-25 YEARS OLD
MALE: AROUND 55-60 YEARS OLD

00:39:20.720 --> 00:39:23.160 line:80%
This is your number?

00:39:23.240 --> 00:39:24.760 line:80%
Yes. Should I use yours?

00:39:25.440 --> 00:39:26.840 line:80%
I don't have a pager.

00:39:26.920 --> 00:39:28.360 line:80%
Why do you not want to stay
in the criminal department?

00:39:28.440 --> 00:39:29.640 line:80%
You're too naive.

00:39:32.800 --> 00:39:34.080 line:80%
Officer He.

00:39:34.160 --> 00:39:37.400 line:80%
I believe we should first figure out
the motive behind their disappearance.

00:39:37.480 --> 00:39:39.640 line:80%
Isn't it clear enough? It's a prank.

00:39:40.240 --> 00:39:41.400 line:80%
Then tell me.

00:39:41.480 --> 00:39:43.400 line:80%
Why did the woman take off her heels
when she entered the elevator?

00:39:43.480 --> 00:39:45.920 line:80%
And why did she hold the heels
with her teeth?

00:39:46.000 --> 00:39:48.640 line:80%
Why did the old man press all the buttons
in the elevator before he left?

00:39:48.720 --> 00:39:50.560 line:80%
Because it's a prank. Understood?

00:39:50.640 --> 00:39:52.760 line:80%
Then why did they disappear
in that locked space?

00:39:52.840 --> 00:39:54.280 line:80%
-Why, why, why.
-Why did they…

00:39:54.360 --> 00:39:56.040 line:80%
Do you only know how to repeat why?

00:39:56.120 --> 00:39:58.920 line:80%
Our priority should be to find out
how they disappear in Yuanlongli.

00:39:59.000 --> 00:40:00.880 line:80%
That's redundant.

00:40:00.960 --> 00:40:03.880 line:80%
Find them, and you'll know
how they disappear.

00:40:03.960 --> 00:40:05.200 line:80%
Listen to me.

00:40:05.280 --> 00:40:08.360 line:80%
Find them, and they
will give you the answer.

00:40:10.440 --> 00:40:11.600 line:80%
Why should I listen to you?

00:40:13.680 --> 00:40:14.840 line:80%
Fine.

00:40:18.160 --> 00:40:21.440 line:80%
NANSHAN TYPEWRITING

00:40:22.360 --> 00:40:23.320 line:80%
Wait.

00:40:24.040 --> 00:40:25.720 line:80%
You see those rickshaw riders?

00:40:26.800 --> 00:40:28.640 line:80%
Should we have a wager?

00:40:28.720 --> 00:40:29.720 line:80%
Go to them.

00:40:29.800 --> 00:40:31.880 line:80%
If you can get their names,

00:40:31.960 --> 00:40:33.760 line:80%
I'll take orders from you.

00:40:33.840 --> 00:40:35.200 line:80%
If you fail to do that,

00:40:35.280 --> 00:40:37.080 line:80%
you take orders from me.

00:40:37.160 --> 00:40:38.160 line:80%
What do you say?

00:40:39.360 --> 00:40:40.360 line:80%
No, thanks.

00:40:43.160 --> 00:40:45.360 line:80%
Didn't you want to find out how they left?

00:40:45.440 --> 00:40:48.520 line:80%
I remember the missing persons
came on a rickshaw.

00:41:00.840 --> 00:41:02.320 line:80%
Mister, where do you want to go?

00:41:02.400 --> 00:41:03.240 line:20%
Mister, where do you want to go?

00:41:03.320 --> 00:41:05.360 line:20%
-Mister, where do you want to go?
-Mister, where do you want to go?

00:41:05.440 --> 00:41:07.080 line:20%
Hello, everyone.

00:41:07.160 --> 00:41:08.760 line:80%
I am from the criminal department
of Nanshan police station.

00:41:08.840 --> 00:41:10.360 line:20%
I'd like to know…

00:41:11.760 --> 00:41:12.680 line:80%
Hey!

00:41:14.480 --> 00:41:15.520 line:80%
Hey…

00:41:18.000 --> 00:41:19.200 line:80%
Mister!

00:41:21.280 --> 00:41:22.240 line:80%
Mister!

00:41:30.960 --> 00:41:33.640 line:80%
Do you understand why I didn't leave
the police station's number?

00:41:33.720 --> 00:41:35.840 line:80%
You look like an imperial envoy
who visits a village.

00:41:35.920 --> 00:41:37.880 line:80%
Wearing a pair of slacks
won't make it easier to catch a criminal.

00:41:37.960 --> 00:41:39.440 line:80%
You look posh.

00:41:39.520 --> 00:41:41.320 line:80%
You speak like an officer,

00:41:41.400 --> 00:41:43.680 line:80%
and you couldn't even get the names
of those rickshaw riders.

00:41:43.760 --> 00:41:45.520 line:80%
You're telling me you want
to investigate the case?

00:41:49.160 --> 00:41:51.880 line:80%
Officer He, when I was studying,

00:41:51.960 --> 00:41:54.320 line:80%
I looked into renowned cases of missing
persons, both local and international.

00:41:54.400 --> 00:41:56.640 line:80%
Specifically, their psychology
and behavior.

00:41:56.720 --> 00:41:59.560 line:80%
My judgment tells me that
the Yuanlongli case isn't just a prank.

00:42:00.160 --> 00:42:05.120 line:80%
Have you looked into the missing person
case in Weinan Street, Weiyang City?

00:42:07.040 --> 00:42:07.880 line:80%
No.

00:42:07.960 --> 00:42:09.400 line:80%
Do you know why?

00:42:10.720 --> 00:42:12.960 line:80%
After I was assigned
to Weiyang, for 22 years,

00:42:13.040 --> 00:42:16.880 line:80%
whenever someone or even a pet

00:42:16.960 --> 00:42:21.520 line:80%
in my district went missing,
I could find them with my eyes closed.

00:42:21.600 --> 00:42:24.520 line:80%
I didn't need to study
renowned missing person cases.

00:42:25.160 --> 00:42:28.440 line:80%
But hanging up posters
and waiting for calls is too passive.

00:42:28.520 --> 00:42:30.640 line:80%
And your initiatives
bring trouble to others.

00:42:30.720 --> 00:42:31.960 line:80%
To whom?

00:42:32.040 --> 00:42:33.880 line:80%
When you sent the evidence
to the Forensic Department,

00:42:33.960 --> 00:42:35.120 line:80%
why did you leave my name?

00:42:37.000 --> 00:42:39.960 line:80%
I only came here yesterday.
They won't acknowledge my signature.

00:42:43.880 --> 00:42:46.200 line:80%
Get out of the car.
Get yourself back to the station

00:42:46.280 --> 00:42:48.280 line:80%
and withdraw all analysis requests
under my name.

00:42:50.520 --> 00:42:52.600 line:80%
Take me to Yuanlongli.
I'll examine the scene again.

00:42:52.680 --> 00:42:54.560 line:80%
Did I owe you a favor? Get out of the car.

00:42:54.640 --> 00:42:56.600 line:80%
It's an official vehicle.
Why should I leave?

00:42:56.680 --> 00:42:57.920 line:80%
Official vehicle?

00:42:58.000 --> 00:42:59.480 line:80%
This is my personal car.

00:42:59.560 --> 00:43:01.120 line:80%
I paid for the petrol from my own pocket.

00:43:01.200 --> 00:43:02.880 line:80%
And I printed these things
with my own money.

00:43:02.960 --> 00:43:06.160 line:80%
You think you're the only one
with integrity? I have it too.

00:43:07.560 --> 00:43:09.000 line:80%
Get out of the car.

00:43:10.320 --> 00:43:11.440 line:80%
Officer He.

00:43:11.520 --> 00:43:13.440 line:80%
Based on my deduction,

00:43:13.520 --> 00:43:15.440 line:80%
the unusual behavior
from those two missing persons

00:43:15.520 --> 00:43:18.000 line:80%
seems to be motivated
by some external coercion.

00:43:18.080 --> 00:43:20.160 line:80%
Many homicides also started
as a missing person case.

00:43:20.240 --> 00:43:21.760 line:80%
What homicide?

00:43:21.840 --> 00:43:24.440 line:80%
There has never been a murder on my turf.

00:43:24.520 --> 00:43:26.760 line:80%
You came, and there's a murder
all of a sudden.

00:43:28.080 --> 00:43:30.840 line:80%
Murphy's law. Whatever you don't
want to happen will happen.

00:43:30.920 --> 00:43:33.080 line:80%
I don’t care about your law.
I don’t care about your homicide.

00:43:33.160 --> 00:43:35.120 line:80%
You lost the bet just now.

00:43:35.200 --> 00:43:37.840 line:80%
So you take orders from me.
I now order you to return to the station

00:43:37.920 --> 00:43:40.040 line:80%
and withdraw the analysis requests
under my name.

00:43:40.120 --> 00:43:41.040 line:80%
He Yuanhang!

00:43:42.120 --> 00:43:43.520 line:80%
You do not have what it takes
to be a criminal police officer.

00:44:39.520 --> 00:44:44.240 line:80%
PATTIA CLUB, THAI MASSAGE